      "message": "test(setup): the setup-link round trip pins the v56 floor, not the exact version\n\nlinks_round_trip_and_older_or_broken_files_are_read_by_name asserted\nPROJECT_VERSION == 56, so the next rung (#368's tool body, v57) failed it\nthough links still round-trip. Assert the floor instead, as #344 did for\nthe probe's kind-order test.\n\nRefs #368\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
