      "message": "test(setup): the version floors are compile-time asserts (clippy assertions_on_constants)\n\nassert!(PROJECT_VERSION >= N) on a const trips clippy's\nassertions_on_constants under -D warnings (batch tier); a const _: () =\nassert!(...) checks the same floor at compile time and is lint-clean.\n\nRefs #368\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
